# FSD Architecture

Layers (top → bottom): `app` → `pages` → `widgets` → `features` → `entities` → `shared`.

## Import rules

- Import only from lower layers. Never import upward.
- Cross-import between slices of the same layer is forbidden (no `features/a` → `features/b`).
- Prefer public API: `@/entities/repair-order`, not deep paths into `api/` / `model/` / `ui/`.
- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*`.

## Slice layout

```
entities/<name>/
  api/
  model/
  ui/          # optional
  index.ts     # public API only

features/<domain>/<action>/
  model/
  ui/          # optional
  index.ts

widgets/<Name>/
  <Name>.tsx
  <Name>.module.scss
  index.ts

pages/<Name>/
  <Name>.tsx
  <Name>.module.scss
  index.ts
```

## Placement

- Domain types + API → `entities`
- User scenarios (create/login/search) → `features`
- Composed UI blocks → `widgets`
- Route screens → `pages`
- App-wide store/router/providers → `app`
- Reusable infra/UI/config → `shared`

## References

- Entity: `src/entities/repair-order`
- Feature: `src/features/repair-order/create`
- Page: `src/pages/RepairCreatePage`
